  "cache:posts": {
    "entries": {
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/asimahmood_nextjs-frontend-developer-location-karachi-activity-7450882245944385536-B1LW": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T23:18:39.678432+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Next.js Frontend Developer\nLocation: Karachi\n\nWe are looking for a skilled Next.js Frontend Developer to join our growing team. If you’re passionate about building fast, scalable, and user-friendly web applications, we’d love to hear from you!\n\nKey Responsibilities:\nDevelop and maintain web applications using Next.js and React.js\nBuild reusable, efficient, and scalable frontend components\nOptimize applications for maximum speed and performance\nCollaborate with backend developers and designers\nEnsure responsiveness across devices and browsers\n\nRequirements:\nProven experience with Next.js and React.js\nStrong grip on JavaScript (ES6+), HTML5, CSS3\nExperience with API integration (REST/GraphQL)\nFamiliarity with version control (Git)\nUnderstanding of SEO and web performance optimization\nGood problem-solving and communication skills\nExposure to POS or eCommerce solutions\n\nApply Now: Share your profile at jobs@imtiaz.com.pk, mentioning “Next.js Developer” in the subject line",
          "posted_at": "2026-04-17T12:25:58.105Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/china-produces-about-85-of-the-worlds-cathode-share-7516513337908633600-8_eD": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T23:18:39.678432+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "China produces about 85% of the world's cathode active material. The West needs new battery chemistries to compete, but traditional R&D can take years to deliver them. \n \nToday, we announced $45M in funding to change that. \n \nBacked by  Zone II Ventures, and Course Corrected, we're scaling our AI-powered Discovery Engine, which combines 18 years of proprietary battery data with automated labs that physically build and test new materials. Over these 18 years our platform has run more than 225 projects for more than 85 customers across the battery value chain, including nearly a dozen Fortune 500 companies, and has resulted in more than 100 battery patents.  Along the way, the platform generated an internally consistent dataset covering more than 500,000 physical cells tested at over 165 million cycles.  \n \nOur technology has already helped deliver DRX, a new family of nickel- and cobalt-free cathode materials designed to reduce dependence on China. Now, we're bringing DRX toward commercialization while using AI to accelerate the next generation of breakthroughs. \n \nLed by founder and CEO Mathias Ingvarsson, COO and former Tesla manufacturing leader Steven Prast, and Chief Scientific Officer Dee Strand, we're building a faster path from battery discovery to commercial deployment. \n \nRead more in Fortune by Nick Lichtenberg. Article link in the first comment.",
          "posted_at": "2026-10-15T15:00:30.119Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/global-jobs-opportunity_front-end-developer-nextjs-location-activity-7515724297680809985-NZIl": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T23:18:39.678432+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "🚀 Front-End Developer (Next.js)\n📍 Location: Near Jail Chowrangi, Karachi\nWork Arrangement: On-site\n💼 Job Type: Full-Time\n💰 Salary: Negotiable\nPosted: 2026-10-13\n\n🔗 Full details: https://lnkd.in/dH8JtUTf",
          "posted_at": "2026-10-13T10:45:07.970Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/josephcass_breaking-brookfield-announces-huge-27-billion-share-7523323322541969408-zmpB": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T23:18:39.678432+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "BREAKING: Brookfield announces HUGE $27 BILLION AI data centre project in the UK! \n\nBrookfield has partnered with British energy company Drax Group and AI business Radiant to develop one of the UK’s largest AI data centres at Drax Power Station in the north of England. \n\nBloomberg reports that the project could attract more than $27 Billion billion in investment, with an initial $3.3 Billion planned for the first phase, backed by Brookfield’s partnership with the Qatar Investment Authority.\n\nThe idea is to build the data centre alongside an existing power station, giving it access to the enormous amounts of electricity needed to run AI technology. Drax CEO Will Gardiner said: “If constructed in full, this project could become one of the largest data centres in the UK.” Brookfield's Connor Teskey recently said of AI infrastructure: \"there is no shortage of capital - and there is no shortage of demand.\"\n\nBig news for European AI infrastructure!\n\nFollow Joseph Cass for finance news and insights.",
          "posted_at": "2026-11-03T10:00:57.048Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/karachi-jobsz_were-hiring-web-developer-frontend-php-activity-7476920524120604672-0VQx": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T23:18:39.678432+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "We're Hiring: Web Developer (Frontend + PHP / Next.js)\n\nPARADIGM DIGITAL SOLUTIONS (PVT) LTD is looking for a skilled Web Developer to build, maintain, and keep our websites running in top shape.\n\nIf you write clean code, care about performance, and like owning a site end-to-end, we'd love to hear from you.\n\nWhat we're looking for:\nStrong hands-on experience with HTML and CSS\nSolid PHP development skills\nProven experience with Next.js (and React, which it's built on)\nExperience with site health management diagnosing and fixing technical issues, performance monitoring, and general upkeep\nAttention to detail and a problem-solving mindset\nAbility to work independently and meet deadlines\n\n📍 Location: DMCHS, Karachi (Onsite)\n🕘 Shift Timing: 8:00 PM – 5:00 AM\n🏢 Job Type: Onsite, Full-time\n\nSend your resume and portfolio to hr@paradigmdigitals.com",
          "posted_at": "2026-06-28T08:52:47.387Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/shahidahmedhod_were-hiring-frontend-developer-nextjs-activity-7457038491210686464-qDTI": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T23:18:39.678432+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "We’re Hiring: Frontend Developer (Next.js)\n\nLocation: Karachi (On-site)\n\nWe are seeking a skilled Frontend Developer (Next.js) to join our team. If you are passionate about building modern, high-performance web applications, this is a great opportunity to grow your career.\n\n🔹 Key Responsibilities:\nDevelop and maintain web applications using Next.js and React\nBuild responsive and user-friendly interfaces\nCollaborate with cross-functional teams\nOptimize applications for speed and scalability\nWrite clean, maintainable, and reusable code\n\n🔹 Requirements:\nHands-on experience with Next.js and React.js\nStrong command of JavaScript (ES6+), HTML5, and CSS3\nExperience with API integration (REST/GraphQL)\nFamiliarity with Git/version control\nUnderstanding of performance optimization\n\n📩 How to Apply:\n Share your resume and portfolio at Jobs@imtiaz.com.pk",
          "posted_at": "2026-05-04T12:08:41.364Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sherin-lee-joseph_hiring-angular-developer-nodejs-nextjs-activity-7463223113414168577-lRUk": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T23:18:39.678432+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Hiring: Angular Developer | Node.js | Next.js\nLocation: Karachi, Pakistan\nExperience: 4–6 Years\nJob Type: Full-Time\n\nWe are looking for a talented Angular Developer with strong experience in Node.js and Next.js to join our growing development team.\n\nRequired Skills:Angular,Node.js,Next.js,TypeScript\nREST APIs,MongoDB / PostgreSQL,Git\n\nResponsibilities: \nBuild scalable web applications\nDevelop responsive frontend interfaces\nCreate backend APIs using Node.js\nCollaborate with designers and developers\nOptimize application performance and scalability\n\nInterested candidates can apply - DM/email(sherin_lee@mvisionit.com)",
          "posted_at": "2026-05-21T13:44:10.171Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/shoaibahmedbaig_hiring-a-developer-gulshan-e-iqbal-karachi-activity-7496872928731426817-mDma": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T23:18:39.678432+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Hiring a developer. Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. On-site.\n\nNext.js, TypeScript, Postgres.\n\nReal system. Thousands of orders a day, real money, no staging, work in production...\n\nPlease Claude Code is not a skill. Knowing when it's wrong -> is.\n\nMinimum 3 years.\n\nSalary: 90k–150k\n\nCV to shoaib@elyscents.pk  and tell me one bug you found that everyone else said wasn't there.\n\nJazakAllah",
